ass=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ُّغْنُونَ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا مِنْ عَذَابِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ش</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">َىْءٍ‌ۚ ق</span>َالُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَوْ هَدَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>نَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ لَهَدَيْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كُمْ‌ۖ سَو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءٌ عَلَيْن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَجَزِعْن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَمْ صَبَرْنَا مَا لَنَا م<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ِن م</span>َّح<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>صٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢١</span>"},{"id":22,"tajweed":"وَقَالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّيْطَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نُ لَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا قُضِىَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَمْرُ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ وَعَدَكُمْ وَعْدَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ وَوَعَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_mutajanisayn\">د</span>تُّكُمْ فَأَخْلَفْتُكُمْ‌ۖ وَمَا كَانَ لِىَ عَلَيْك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن س</span>ُلْطَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نٍ إِلّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>َعَوْتُكُمْ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَجَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>تُمْ لِى‌ۖ فَلَا تَلُومُونِى وَلُوم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>ُسَك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم‌ۖ م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَنَا۟ بِمُصْرِخِكُمْ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa_shafawi\">ُم ب</span>ِمُصْرِخِىَّ‌ۖ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ِى كَفَرْتُ بِم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَشْرَكْتُمُونِ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لُ‌ۗ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِمِينَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٢</span>"},{"id":23,"tajweed":"وَأُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>خِلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> وَعَمِلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ جَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">تٍ ت</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رِى مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َحْتِهَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَنْهَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>رُ خَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِدِينَ فِيهَا بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهِمْ‌ۖ تَحِيَّتُهُمْ فِيهَا سَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ـٰ</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٣</span>"},{"id":24,"tajweed":"أَلَمْ تَرَ كَيْفَ ضَرَبَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ مَثَل<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">اً ك</span>َلِمَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةً ط</span>َيِّبَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةً ك</span>َشَجَرَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةٍ ط</span>َيِّبَةٍ أَصْلُهَا ثَابِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">تٌ و</span>َفَرْعُهَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٤</span>"},{"id":25,"tajweed":"تُؤْت<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أُكُلَهَا كُلَّ حِي<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">نِۭ ب</span>ِإِذْنِ رَبِّهَا‌ۗ وَيَضْرِبُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَمْثَالَ لِل<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَذَكَّر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٥</span>"},{"id":26,"tajweed":"وَمَثَلُ كَلِمَةٍ خَبِيثَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةٍ ك</span>َشَجَرَةٍ خَبِيثَةٍ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>تُثَّتْ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ف</span>َوْقِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ مَا لَهَا مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رٍ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٦</span>"},{"id":27,"tajweed":"يُثَبِّتُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَوْلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ثَّابِتِ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">و</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ٰ</span>ةِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دُّنْيَا وَفِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةِ‌ۖ وَيُضِلُّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لِمِينَ‌ۚ وَيَفْعَلُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ مَا يَش<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٧</span>"},{"id":28,"tajweed":"۞ أَلَمْ تَرَ إِلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ بَدَّلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> نِعْمَتَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ كُفْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا و</span>َأَحَلُّو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> قَوْمَهُمْ دَارَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٨</span>"},{"id":29,"tajweed":"جَهَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َمَ يَصْلَوْنَهَا‌ۖ وَبِئْسَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢٩</span>"},{"id":30,"tajweed":"وَجَعَلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لِلَّهِ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">دًا ل</span>ِّيُضِلُّو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن س</span>َبِيلِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span>‌ۗ قُلْ تَمَتَّعُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ مَصِيرَكُمْ إِلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٠</span>"},{"id":31,"tajweed":"قُل لِّعِبَادِىَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> يُقِيمُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّلَ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">و</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ٰ</span>ةَ وَيُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>ِقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا رَزَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>نَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُمْ سِر<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ًّا و</span>َعَلَانِيَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِ أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ي</span>َأْتِىَ يَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">مٌ ل</span>َّا بَيْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">عٌ ف</span>ِيهِ وَلَا خِلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ـٰ</span>لٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣١</span>"},{"id":32,"tajweed":"ٱللَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى خَلَقَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>َلَ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِ م<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ءً ف</span>َأَخْرَجَ بِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ثَّمَر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ رِزْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">قًا ل</span>َّكُمْ‌ۖ وَسَخَّرَ لَكُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفُلْكَ لِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>رِىَ فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَحْرِ بِأَمْرِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span>‌ۖ وَسَخَّرَ لَكُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَنْهَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ـٰ</span>رَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٢</span>"},{"id":33,"tajweed":"وَسَخَّرَ لَكُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّمْسَ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَمَرَ د<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓئِبَيْنِ‌ۖ وَسَخَّرَ لَكُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلَ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٣</span>"},{"id":34,"tajweed":"وَءَاتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>ُلِّ مَا سَأَلْتُمُوهُ‌ۚ وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َعُدُّو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> نِعْمَتَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ لَا تُحْصُوه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ‌ۗ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نس</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نَ لَظَلُو<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">مٌ ك</span>َفّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٤</span>"},{"id":35,"tajweed":"وَإِذْ قَالَ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>ر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>هِيمُ رَبِّ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>عَلْ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَلَدَ ءَامِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نًا و</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>نُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>نِى وَبَنِىَّ أ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َن ن</span>َّعْبُدَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَصْن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">َا</span>مَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٥</span>"},{"id":36,"tajweed":"رَبِّ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ أَضْلَلْنَ كَثِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسِ‌ۖ فَمَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َبِعَنِى فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ِى‌ۖ وَمَنْ عَصَانِى فَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكَ غَفُو<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">رٌ ر</span>َّح<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٦</span>"},{"id":37,"tajweed":"رَّبَّن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أَسْكَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ذ</span>ُرِّيَّتِى بِوَادٍ غَيْرِ ذِى زَرْعٍ عِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ند</span>َ بَيْتِكَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُحَرَّمِ رَبَّنَا لِيُقِيمُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّلَ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">و</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ٰ</span>ةَ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span>عَلْ أَفْــِٔدَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َاسِ تَهْو<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> إِلَيْهِمْ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>رْزُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>ه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ثَّمَر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَشْكُر<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٧</span>"},{"id":38,"tajweed":"رَبَّن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َكَ تَعْلَمُ مَا نُخْفِى وَمَا نُعْلِنُ‌ۗ وَمَا يَخْفَىٰ عَلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ش</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">َىْءٍ ف</span>ِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَلَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obliga